{
  "id": "DEU.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Kūshokeela 8",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgaliili bo ng'wa SEEBA mu lūgendo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi gete mushishikīlīje pyī ī shilagīlo īsho nalīmulagīla ī lelo yenīyī. Nguno hū mukwikala mulī bapanga, nīyo hū mukūkwīla ng'wiyongeje; hangī mukūja mukīdime nī sī īyo SEEBA wabisagīja bakūlūgenji bing'we mu kūbilahīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwa aho walī ng'witogolo, ū mu shikū ījo SEEBA Mulungu wako walūkūtongeelaga ū mu nzīla pyī ī myaka makūmi anè yose īyī, kūlwa kūkūlanga widoohya, na kūkūgema ashibone īsho shilīmo ū mu ng'holò yako; ūlū gīkī ūdūgije kūshidima ī shilagīlo shakwe nūūlū yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakwītīla mihayo mingī ya kūkūlanga kwidoohya, ūkūdīīja nzala, hanuma ya henaho ūkūlisha eemanu; shilīwa īsho walī ūtashimanile ū bebe pye na a bakūlūgenji bako. Nguno walī atogilwe kūkūlanga gīkī, ū munhū atūbiza mpanga kūlwa nguno ya shilīīwa gwike, alīyo kūlwa būlī mhayo ūyo gūkūfuma mu nomo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu myaka yose makūmi anè yenīyo ūtakoyiwe būzuuka, nūūlū kūbimba magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shikwigelile ūdeebe ū mu ng'holò yako gīkī, ūmo munhū akang'hūgūlīlaga ng'wana wakwe, nū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūkūhūgūlaga gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū shidimage gete ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūshimīzīle mu nzīla jakwe na mu kūng'ogoha wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkūtwala kū sī yawiza, sī ya myongo na malambo ga minzī; na nzwīlo ja kwikala jikūpumunhīkaga minzī mu malago na mu ngūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīkūtwala kū sī ya ngano na būsīga wingī, hamò na mizabibu na mitiini na mikomamanga, na mizeituni na būūkī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sī ītī ya kūgeehelwa shilīwa, nūūlū kūgeehelwa na shikolo shingī shose shose yaya, sī ya mawe galī na chūūma, nū mu ngūlū jayo ūdūgije kūfukūūla mo chūūma sha feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū ūlya wigūta ūkūnkumīlīja ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, kūlwa nguno ya kūkwinha sī yawiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanage ūtizūdoosa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanage ūtizūng'wība ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, wībe ū kūshimīzīla ū mu kahelele kakwe, nī shilagīlo shakwe na a malange gakwe ayo nalīkwinha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūkūlya wigūta, ūzenga na numba jawiza wikala mo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a madaale gako ga ng'ombe, na a ga ng'holo na mbūli gūūkūla; ūkūkwīja na zahabu būyaga nī feza, nī shikolo ī shingī īsho ūlī nasho shūkūkwīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ī ng'holò yako īshikile kūdoosa, ūng'wība ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūyo wakwīnja kūfuma mu sī ya Misili, ī sī ya būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene ūyo akakūbītya ng'witogolo igalī na lyakogohya, mu sī ng'halamuku ya notà ng'halī; ūmo jilīmo na nzoka ja būsūngū wabūbi, hamò na ng'homi; ū mu shikū jenījo akakwinha minzī kūfuma mu shiganga shidiimu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene ūyo akakwinha eemanu ya kūlya aho ūl'ū ng'witogolo lyenīlo, shilīwa īsho bakūlūgenji bako baalī batashimanile na hado yaya. Wakwinhaga gīkī akūlange kwidoohya, na gīkī akūgeme; kūlwa gīkī ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi ī mihayo yako īkūbeelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūshikile nūūlū kwiwīla, “Būdūla wane waninhile ū būsabi wenūbū, naasabiwe nguzu ja nkono gwane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ng'wizūkagwe ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, nguno hū ng'wene akūkwinhaga ū būdūla ū wa kūpandīka ī sabo; kūlwa kūlīshikīlīja ilagane īlo walī wabeeja na bakūlūgenji bako mu kwilahīla, gīt'ūmo īlī ī mihayo nī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūhūbīla ūng'wība ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, wandya kūlondeela bamulungu bangī na kūbatūmamīla, na kūbinamīla; ī lelo yenīyī nalīmumanya hape, gīkī mukūyagaala gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo SEEBA akagakenaagūlīla mahanga ayo akagayagaja gūūng'wīngīla a bing'we, na a bing'we mukūyagaala ūlū ng'ūleka kūng'wigwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
